# langchain-arangodb bumped to >=1.2.0 — restores the filter_clause behavioral
# fix-pin that was deferred during the v1.5 lock compilation. >=1.2.0 carries
# the `filter_clause` named-param fix on ArangoVector's similarity-search
# methods (the 0.0.4 release swallowed it via **kwargs, so the category FILTER
# never reached the AQL — that silent-drop bug is gone at >=1.2.0), so the
# label filter is real at this pin. The bump restores the originally-intended
# minimum version; compiled-lock fidelity with v1.5's shipped set no longer
# constrains us since the fix-pin is now the floor.
